d5 — Repository License Notice

This repository is a super-app ecosystem combining many projects.
The full text of every merged project's license is collected in
ALL-LICENSES.md (nothing deleted, only combined into one file).
Each project's own license file also stays inside its folder under
projects/. This root file does not relicense any part; it states how
the combined collection applies.

1. How the combined file works

- ALL-LICENSES.md is an aggregation: verbatim copies of each
  project's license text, one after another, with attribution
  preserved. It is a finding aid, not a new license.
- Each file, folder, and project under projects/ remains under its
  own original license terms. Where a project folder contains a
  LICENSE, LICENCE, or COPYING file, that file governs its contents.
- In case of conflict, the per-project license file prevails over
  this root notice and over the collected copy in ALL-LICENSES.md.

